# RTPI Subdomain Manifest — single source of truth for build.sh, cert_manager.sh,
# cloudflare_dns_manager.sh, and the Cloudflare Access Terraform module.
#
# Format: pipe-delimited, one row per public subdomain. Whitespace around
# fields is trimmed. Lines starting with '#' and blank lines are ignored.
#
# Fields:
#   suffix        — appended to the slug (e.g. "-reports"). Empty = bare slug
#                   (so the row produces "${SLUG}.${CF_DOMAIN}").
#   profile_gate  — docker compose profile required for this subdomain to be
#                   provisioned. Empty = always-on, regardless of profile.
#                   Multiple profiles may be listed comma-separated; the row
#                   is included if ANY of them is in the active profile set.
#   upstream_url  — what nginx proxy_pass targets on the host.
#   websocket     — true|false; adds Upgrade/Connection: upgrade headers.
#   tls_upstream  — true|false; if true, nginx sets proxy_ssl_verify off and
#                   the proxy_pass URL must already be https://.
#
# To add a new RTPI surface to public DNS + Cloudflare Access:
#   1. Append one row here.
#   2. Append one matching application to
#      infra/cloudflare-access/terraform.tfvars.example (and your real tfvars).
#
# Notes on entries below:
#   • -kasm  is the Kasm Workspaces management plane (admin / session broker).
#   • -vscode and -kali are direct per-workspace front doors. Cloudflare
#     Access gates entry; Kasm's own VNC password gates the desktop session.
#   • -wiki  (Docmost) is bound to 127.0.0.1:13000 in compose; nginx is the
#     only intended way to reach it from outside the host.

# suffix    | profile_gate | upstream_url            | websocket | tls_upstream
            |              | http://localhost:5000   | false     | false
-reports    | sysreptor    | http://localhost:7777   | false     | false
-empire     |              | http://localhost:1337   | false     | false
-mgmt       | management   | https://localhost:9443  | false     | true
-kasm       | kasm         | https://localhost:8443  | true      | true
-wiki       | docmost      | http://localhost:13000  | false     | false
-vscode     | kasm         | https://localhost:6901  | true      | true
-kali       | kasm         | https://localhost:6902  | true      | true
-workbench  |              | http://localhost:3020  | false     | false
